[00:23.18]1. Firm and determined in this time of the end,
[00:29.70]Prepared are God’s servants the good news to defend.
[00:35.20]The Devil has fought and opposed them.
[00:40.18]With Jehovah, they take their stand against him.
[00:45.82](Chorus)
[00:46.20]Then forward, you Witnesses, ever strong of heart!
[00:52.50]Rejoice that in God’s work, you too may have a part!
[00:57.62]Go tell far and wide that the Paradise is near
[01:02.92]And that soon all its blessings will be here.
[01:27.38]2. Servants of Jah do not seek a life of ease;
[01:32.30]The world and its rulers we do not try to please.
[01:37.68]Unspotted at all times remaining,
[01:42.96]Our integrity we will keep maintaining.
[01:48.74](Chorus)
[01:49.10]Then forward, you Witnesses, ever strong of heart!
[01:54.82]Rejoice that in God’s work, you too may have a part!
[02:00.52]Go tell far and wide that the Paradise is near
[02:05.90]And that soon all its blessings will be here.
[02:16.14]3. God and his Kingdom are mocked and pushed aside;
[02:40.96]His great name is slandered, its holiness denied.
[02:46.48]Let’s share in its sanctification,
[02:51.52]And declare it to ev’ry tribe and nation.
[02:57.84](Chorus)
[02:58.28]Then forward, you Witnesses, ever strong of heart!
[03:03.52]Rejoice that in God’s work, you too may have a part!
[03:09.12]Go tell far and wide that the Paradise is near
[03:14.42]And that soon all its blessings will be here.
